    "actualBudgets": "中心固定profile值必须有限正数/精确整数；所有请求/帧同时受中心绝对deadline。read取原timeoutSeconds较小值，初始create有界，响应wire/行/SDK frame/总量分别有界。"
  },
  "centerPort": {
    "acquire(operation_id) -> OpenAIGrant": "一次CAS许可；未知不重授。必须核服务身份、已begin当前run/lease/attempt、固定节点分支/版本/参数、资源启用/撤权、动态messages、逐次费用审批和配额；grant仅私有通道。当前无正式中心实现。",
    "assert_active(grant) -> None": "发送前、读取与提交帧前、finish前核对许可/租约/取消/撤权；边界等待同时受总deadline。",
    "commit_frame(grant, sequence, frame, terminal=False, provider_error_code=None) -> FrameCommit": "持久完整实际SDK model_dump JSON帧，不删nullable delta/reasoning/usage扩展、不造choices。帧序号独立于run events，从1递增；同seq同原帧幂等、异帧拒绝。每帧ACK operation_id/resource_id/resource_version/provider/sequence/state=RUNNING/done=false/failure_kind=null；真实finish也先以RUNNING持久。",
    "finish_stream(grant, last_sequence, terminal_sequence, finish_reason) -> StreamFinishCommit": "中心行锁/CAS引用已经持久真实finish帧与最后usage帧，不增/改/伪造帧；校验所有序号连续、原finish_reason及绑定、末尾仅合法usage。ACK包含FrameCommit全部字段和finish_sequence/last_sequence，sequence=last_sequence；stop=>COMPLETED/done=true/failure_kind=null，合法非stop=>FAILED/done=true/failure_kind=provider。未知/坏ACK不交成功，不重发许可。",
    "confirm_stop(grant, reason) -> StopConfirmation": "相同绑定、状态CANCELLED/COMPLETED/FAILED、provider_stopped精确true和真实非空proof_id才确认。没有真实Provider停止接口/证据时EFFECT_UNKNOWN；本地close不授予此证明。",
    "record_failure(grant, FailureFacts) -> None": "只含failure_kind/code/send_attempted/local_closed/provider_stop_confirmed；中心持久操作/费用/effect/审计，不覆写已确认COMPLETED/FAILED，不造rollback或run终态。"
  },
  "privateTransportPort": {
    "create_transport(material: OpenAIPrivateMaterial, limits: OpenAILimits) -> httpx.AsyncBaseTransport": "只构造可协作取消、有界清理、无日志的私有固定TLS/出口，不发送业务请求；没有默认实现。包装层只接受一次固定目标POST/正确私有Authorization，禁止redirect/env代理，response要可aclose。返回前取消/超时由实现清理未交付句柄。",
    "cleanup": "跟踪SDK stream、transport.response、AsyncOpenAI client或部分构造http_client/transport；优先aclose，兼容close，每个有界。SDK构造失败仍关闭HTTPX和私有transport；已知中心终态后清理失败只报PRODUCER_CLEANUP_UNKNOWN，不覆盖操作终态。"
  },
